cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This is an experimental, unreleased development milestone with a complete
  strict static implementation ledger for the public API at the pinned QETLAB
  revision. This is not a QETLAB/MATLAB parity, API-stability, release, or human
  review claim; please cite the exact version and commit used.
type: software
title: QuantumEntanglementTools.jl
abstract: >-
  An independent Julia package providing a certificate-aware API for
  quantum-information and entanglement computations, with source-traceable
  mappings for the pinned public QETLAB inventory.
